SUMMARY:Herbs\, Flowers\, and Cocktails: Incorporate your garden into your drinks
DESCRIPTION:Use herbs and flowers to capture emotion in a glass! (with or without alcohol) \n\n\n\nHerbs\, Flowers\, and CocktailsReady to shake up your drink game? Join us in person for a fun session where you’ll learn how to incorporate your garden into refreshing cocktails. From fragrant herbs to vibrant flowers\, discover the power of flavor\, the persuasion of color and shape\, the essence of texture\, and how to capture emotion in a glass with or without alcohol. Cocktails are works of art that feed all of the senses. \n\n\n\nIt’s hands-on\, laid-back\, and perfect for anyone who loves a good sip with a twist. Don’t miss out on blending nature and cocktails like a pro! \n\n\n\nAlcohol not included; please bring a bottle of your favorite spirit. \n\n\n\n\n    get tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/herbs-flowers-and-cocktails-incorporate-your-garden-into-your-drinks/
LOCATION:Ken’s Gardens\, 2467 Old Philadelphia Pike\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/04/KG-CIB-052126-Event-Promo-JPEG.avif
END:VEVENT
