SUMMARY:Creative Mending with Robin Timpson
DESCRIPTION:Join this hands-on creative mending class and learn how to transform your clothing using fabric scraps into beautiful\, functional art. All materials are provided. You’ll learn essential hand-stitching techniques for decorative patching\, and create your own unique patch. By the end of the class\, students will gain the necessary skills to design and apply decorative patches on their clothing\, giving new life to their favorite garments through thoughtful\, sustainable craftsmanship.\n\nWhen: May 23rd\, 10AM-1PM\n\nWhere: The Lancaster Art Vault\, 100 N Queen St\, Lancaster PA\n\nCost: $50 – all materials included \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Learn More
