SUMMARY:Voices of Migration: An Art & Storytelling Celebration
DESCRIPTION:In partnership with the Spanish American Civic Association (SACA)\, join us in celebrating the journeys of Lancaster’s immigrant communities through art and oral histories from elders and Tec Centro graduates. This presentation will highlight a multi-day exhibit at the Ware Center featuring powerful stories of migration\, complemented by a one-day pop-up at Café Centro on June 18. The event also launches the Voices of Migration Art Park\, anchored by a 14-foot steel sculpture of moving Monarch butterflies emerging from a traveling trunk—symbolizing transformation and hope. \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/voices-of-migration-an-art-storytelling-celebration/
LOCATION:Ware Center for the Arts\, 42 N. Prince St.\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2025/10/Voices-of-Migration.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Millersville University Office of Visual & Performing Arts":MAILTO:cori.jackson@millersville.edu
END:VEVENT
