SUMMARY:America250 Family Day at Historic Rock Ford
DESCRIPTION:Join us for family friendly America250 activities during this free event at Historic Rock Ford including:\n\nChildren’s activities\nThemed activities in the General Edward Hand Mansion and “Lancaster’s Revolutionaries” Exhibit in the Snyder Gallery\nInteract with living historians including members of the 1st Rhode Island Regiment and Leslie Bramlett as Hannah Till\n\nConcessions will be available. All proceeds benefit Historic Rock Ford.\n\nRegistration is requested for planning purposes. \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
